# Project Architecture

This is a large-scale React application called Taskool.
Feature-based (module-based) architecture with 6 top-level source folders.

## Folder Structure

src/
├── app/        → skeleton: router, layouts, header, sidebar, footer
├── modules/    → feature domains (auth, bootcamp, hackathon, olympiad, community, payment, profile, study-abroad, steam)
├── features/   → cross-module orchestration (ai-course-generator, onboarding, global-search, notifications)
├── pages/      → static/marketing (landing, about, contact, legal)
├── shared/     → reusable ui, lib, hooks, api, i18n, store, types, utils, constants, styles
└── assets/     → images, icons, fonts (bundled by Vite)

## Module Boundary Rules

- Modules NEVER import from each other's internal files
- Cross-module access ONLY through index.ts (public API)
- Shared logic used by 2+ modules → shared/
- Logic that combines 2+ modules → features/

// ✅ Correct
import { useAuth } from '@/modules/auth'
import { Button } from '@/shared/ui'
import { AICourseGeneratorModal } from '@/features/ai-course-generator'

// ❌ Wrong — never import internal paths
import { useAuth } from '@/modules/auth/hooks/useAuth'
import { Button } from '@/shared/ui/shadcn/button'

## Where Things Live

| What | Where |
|---|---|
| API çağırışları (1 modul) | modules/<n>/api/ |
| API — internships domain (lookup və s., yalnız internships) | modules/internships/shared/api/ |
| API çağırışları (2+ modul, app-wide) | shared/api/ |
| UI (1 modul) | modules/<n>/components/ |
| UI (2+ modul) | shared/ui/custom/ |
| Zustand store (modul) | modules/<n>/store/ |
| Zustand store (qlobal) | shared/store/ |
| Hooks (1 modul) | modules/<n>/hooks/ |
| Hooks (2+ modul) | shared/hooks/ |
| Layout, Header, Sidebar, Footer | app/components/ |
| Landing, About, Contact | pages/ |
| AI generator, Onboarding, Search | features/ |

## Circular Dependency Qaydası

shared/ heç vaxt modules/-ə import etməməlidir.
shared/lib/axios.ts → useAuthStore import etmə — circular dependency yaranır.

